      "review": "Official engineering report testing two default isolation/lock configurations in Tokyo with Go SDK. Repeatable Read ordinary reads use a shared snapshot without acquiring read locks. 12 read-and-append workers and 4 update workers cut foreground p99 41.08 to 20.09 ms. High same-row update contention increased p99 from 34.02 to 65.68 ms and yielded 80 aborts in 480 attempts."
