      "articleId": "2026-11-19-top-2",
      "access": "full",
      "review": "Node worker_threads pool separates synchronous work from the event loop. A 10-core Mac sample with two 3-second jobs observed max health response 6.0 to 0.01 s in the worker cases. Separate 2-vCPU/1-GiB container trial gave completion 13.2 versus 7.75 s for one versus two workers. Bounds on queueing and native crashes remain."
